<Defs>

  <!--磁轨冲（脉冲）-->
  <ThingDef ParentName="BaseHumanMakeableGun">
    <defName>GR_RailPDW</defName>
    <label>Gray Railgun PDW</label>
    <description>Pulse.Its low-pressure rail and compact capacitor provide only modest projectile velocity and a thin EMP coating, but in return grant a blistering rate of fire, exceptional stability, and nearly inaudible operation. This extreme lightweight design design enables lightning-fast target acquisition, making it the perfect partner for infiltration missions and the personal defense weapon of choice for most Grays.</description>
